01:24:38,628 --> 01:24:49,328
本日は、アイドリッシュセブン LIVE PERFORMANCE 2024 “Once Upon a A Stage” にご来場いただきまして、誠にありがとうございます。
Thank you very much for attending IDOLiSH7 LIVE PERFORMANCE 2024 "Once Upon a A Stage" today.

178
01:24:49,928 --> 01:24:56,328
開演に先立ちまして、皆様にいくつかのお願いとご案内がございます。
Before the performance begins, we have a few requests and announcements for you.

179
01:25:00,236 --> 01:25:03,636
皆様にお願い申し上げます。
May I have your attention, please.

180
01:25:04,136 --> 01:25:07,636
お客様の安全確保のため、
For the safety of all guests,

181
01:25:07,636 --> 01:25:12,936
お席を離れての鑑賞はご遠慮いただいております。
please remain in your assigned seats during the show.

182
01:25:13,136 --> 01:25:15,636
あらかじめご了承ください。
Thank you for your understanding.

183
01:25:17,336 --> 01:25:21,136
また、本公演の演出の都合上、
Also, due to stage production reasons,

184
01:25:21,336 --> 01:25:25,136
開演いたしますと、しばらくの間、
once the performance starts, for a brief period,

185
01:25:25,136 --> 01:25:30,336
お席へのご案内をお止めいただく場合がございます。
guidance to your seat may be temporarily paused.

186
01:25:32,136 --> 01:25:38,136
お早めにお手洗いなどお済ませの上、
Please use the restrooms early

187
01:25:38,136 --> 01:25:40,136
お座席にてお待ちください。
and wait at your seat.

188
01:25:40,936 --> 01:25:44,936
本日の公演は、記録撮影のため、
Today's performance will be recorded,

189
01:25:44,936 --> 01:25:49,636
会場内にカメラが設置されております。
so cameras are installed throughout the venue.

190
01:25:51,636 --> 01:25:55,936
客席の様子が写真・映像に
Members of the audience

191
01:25:55,936 --> 01:25:58,636
映り込む場合がございます。
may be captured in photos or video footage.

192
01:25:59,136 --> 01:26:03,336
会場内の写真や映像は、
Photos and footage taken in the venue

193
01:26:03,336 --> 01:26:08,636
公開されることがございます。
may be published or broadcast.

194
01:26:08,636 --> 01:26:15,136
印刷物、メディア等に露出・掲載される場合がございます。
They may be featured in print media or online.

195
01:26:17,136 --> 01:26:23,636
以上をご了承の上、ご鑑賞いただきますようお願いいたします。
Please be aware of this and enjoy the show.

196
01:26:24,636 --> 01:26:29,136
場内での許可のない写真撮影、
Unauthorized photography,

197
01:26:29,136 --> 01:26:37,136
録音、録画、ならびに配信行為は固くお断りいたします。
audio or video recording, and streaming are strictly prohibited.

198
01:26:38,636 --> 01:26:43,636
また、指示のない過度な応援や、
Also, excessive cheering without instruction,

199
01:26:43,636 --> 01:26:48,136
指示のない声を出す行為、
shouting,

200
01:26:48,136 --> 01:26:53,936
周囲のお客様のご迷惑となる行為はお控えください。
or any behavior that disturbs others is strictly forbidden.

201
01:26:54,936 --> 01:27:00,136
場内でのお食事、飲酒、ならびに
Eating, drinking alcohol,

202
01:27:00,136 --> 01:27:02,936
喫煙はお断りいたします。
and smoking inside the venue are prohibited.

203
01:27:03,636 --> 01:27:08,136
本日は、熱中症予防のため、
However, to prevent heat stroke today,

204
01:27:08,136 --> 01:27:13,636
水分補給を目的とした蓋の閉まる容器に入ったお飲み物のみ
only drinks in sealable containers meant for hydration

205
01:27:13,636 --> 01:27:16,136
お持ち込みいただけます。
may be brought into the venue.

206
01:27:16,936 --> 01:27:21,136
演出の妨げや、周りのお客様の
To avoid disrupting the performance

207
01:27:21,136 --> 01:27:25,636
ご迷惑となりますので、客席内での
or bothering other guests,

208
01:27:25,636 --> 01:27:29,936
携帯電話のご使用はお控えください。
please refrain from using mobile phones in the seating area.

209
01:27:31,636 --> 01:27:37,136
アラームなど音の出る機器の電源はお切りいただくか、
Please turn off devices that make noise, such as alarms,

210
01:27:37,136 --> 01:27:44,336
マナーモードに設定していただきますようお願いいたします。
or switch them to silent mode.

211
01:27:45,136 --> 01:27:49,936
あらかじめ体調のすぐれないお客様、
If you feel unwell

212
01:27:49,936 --> 01:27:54,336
または、気分が悪くなりましたら、
or experience a sudden change in health,

213
01:27:54,336 --> 01:28:00,136
無理をなさらず、
please do not push yourself

214
01:28:00,136 --> 01:28:05,136
お近くのスタッフまでお申し出ください。
and inform a nearby staff member.

215
01:30:07,644 --> 01:30:08,944
あ、照明さん
Ah, lighting operator...

216
01:30:09,244 --> 01:30:10,944
もうちょっと右下ー
A little more to the bottom right.

217
01:30:11,644 --> 01:30:13,344
あ、もっと左下ー
Ah, more to the bottom left.

218
01:30:13,844 --> 01:30:15,144
あ、そうそうそうそう
Ah, yes, yes, yes, yes!

219
01:30:15,744 --> 01:30:17,644
いい感じー
That looks great~

220
01:30:18,244 --> 01:30:20,944
じゃ、スイッチ、オン！
Now then, switch... ON!

221
01:30:26,844 --> 01:30:29,644
みんなー！ヤッホー！
Everyone~! Yoo-hoo!

222
01:30:30,144 --> 01:30:32,944
すいちゃんー！よー！
It's Suichan~!

223
01:30:33,844 --> 01:30:35,744
星詠みのみんなー
To all the Hoshiyomi,

224
01:30:35,944 --> 01:30:37,944
今日が初めてのみんなー
and everyone here for the first time today,

225
01:30:38,144 --> 01:30:41,644
会いに来てくれて、ありがとうー！
thank you so much for coming to see me!

226
01:30:42,944 --> 01:30:46,944
いやー、もうすぐ始まるんだけど、その前に！
Man, the show is starting soon, but before that!

227
01:30:50,144 --> 01:30:51,144
おいしょ！
Heave-ho!

228
01:30:51,644 --> 01:30:54,644
ライブマナー！
Live Manners!

229
01:30:55,744 --> 01:30:57,344
ということで、
So then,

230
01:30:57,444 --> 01:31:01,944
すいちゃんからみんなへ、ライブを楽しむためのお願い事が
here are three requests from Suichan

231
01:31:02,144 --> 01:31:05,144
3つあるー！
to help everyone enjoy the live!

232
01:31:05,244 --> 01:31:06,344
まず1つ目！
First off, number one!

233
01:31:09,044 --> 01:31:10,644
ライブ中は、
During the live,

234
01:31:10,744 --> 01:31:13,744
撮影・録音はできないよ！
photography and recording are strictly prohibited!

235
01:31:14,944 --> 01:31:19,444
今日しか見られない景色、一緒に楽しもう！
Let's enjoy this view that can only be seen today together!

236
01:31:20,144 --> 01:31:22,244
次！2つ目！
Next! Number two!

237
01:31:23,144 --> 01:31:27,944
応援してくれるのは、すっごく嬉しい！
I'm super happy that you're cheering for me!

238
01:31:28,044 --> 01:31:30,944
でも、周りが見えなくなると...
But if you lose sight of your surroundings...

239
01:31:31,644 --> 01:31:34,544
すいちゃんかわいいの〜！すいちゃん今日もかわいいの〜！
Suichan is so cute~! Suichan is cute today too~!

240
01:31:35,744 --> 01:31:37,644
すいちゃーん！今日も可愛いー！
Suichaaaannn! You're cute today too!

241
01:31:38,244 --> 01:31:42,944
すいちゃーん！すいちゃーん！すいちゃーん！
Suichan! Suichan! Suichan!

242
01:31:43,644 --> 01:31:48,944
うわー！すいちゃーん！今日も可愛いー！
Woah! Suichan! You're cute today too!

243
01:31:49,944 --> 01:31:56,744
ということで、周りがびっくりしちゃうような大声や行動は、ダメー！
So, yelling or acting in a way that startles people around you is a big no-no!

244
01:31:57,344 --> 01:32:01,144
あと、「すいちゃんは今日もかわいい！」コールも、
Also, saving the "Suichan is cute today too!" chant

245
01:32:01,644 --> 01:32:05,944
すいちゃんが合図するまで、取っておいてね！
until Suichan gives the signal is a must!

246
01:32:06,344 --> 01:32:08,044
そして3つ目！
And number three!

247
01:32:08,144 --> 01:32:12,044
みんな、ペンライト持ってるー？
Everyone, do you have your penlights?

248
01:32:12,144 --> 01:32:14,444
見せて見せてー！
Show me, show me~!

249
01:32:17,144 --> 01:32:20,944
ライブが始まったら、もっと凄くなるね！
Once the live starts, it's gonna look even more amazing!

250
01:32:21,244 --> 01:32:25,044
でも、使うときにはルールがあるー！
But there are rules when using them!

251
01:32:25,944 --> 01:32:28,144
改造ペンライトや
Modified penlights,

252
01:32:28,244 --> 01:32:30,144
26cmを超えるもの、
penlights over 26 cm,

253
01:32:30,244 --> 01:32:32,544
眩しすぎるものは、
or high-brightness ones

254
01:32:32,644 --> 01:32:34,144
使っちゃダメ！
are strictly forbidden!

255
01:32:34,244 --> 01:32:37,644
みんなでルールを守って、楽しいライブにするよ！
Let's all follow the rules and make this a fun live concert!

256
01:32:38,244 --> 01:32:41,044
協力してくれるー？
Will you all cooperate with me?

257
01:32:41,644 --> 01:32:45,144
じゃあ、1回みんなでペンライト消すよー！
Alright, let me see everyone turn off their penlights once!

258
01:32:46,144 --> 01:32:47,444
せーの！
Ready, go!

259
01:32:48,644 --> 01:32:51,944
完璧！ありがとうー！
Perfect! Thank you~!

260
01:32:52,644 --> 01:32:58,144
よし、これで準備OK！みんなもいけるー？
Alright, now we're all set! Is everyone ready too?

261
01:33:06,244 --> 01:33:08,144
それじゃあ...
Well then...

262
01:33:12,644 --> 01:33:14,144
始まるよー！
It's starting~!

263
01:33:22,144 --> 01:33:27,144
STUDIO STELLAR

264
01:34:15,144 --> 01:34:17,244
昔々...
Once upon a time...

265
01:34:17,644 --> 01:34:21,944
キラキラと光る、不思議なお城に...
in a mysterious, sparkling castle...

266
01:34:23,944 --> 01:34:28,944
星街すいせいという、女の子が住んでいました。
there lived a girl named Hoshimachi Suisei.

267
01:34:32,244 --> 01:34:38,144
そこはまるで、おとぎ話の絵本から
It was a wonderful castle that looked as if

268
01:34:38,144 --> 01:34:42,144
飛び出してきたような、素敵なお城です。
it had popped straight out of a fairy tale book.

269
01:34:46,344 --> 01:34:53,644
夜になると、すいせいは窓辺で歌を歌います。
When night fell, Suisei would sing songs by the window.

270
01:35:09,332 --> 01:35:11,332
花火が上がり
As fireworks shoot up,

271
01:35:11,632 --> 01:35:14,332
みんなが笑顔になる
everyone flashes a smile.

272
01:35:14,632 --> 01:35:18,132
キラキラと眩しい
Sparkling and dazzling,

273
01:35:18,632 --> 01:35:21,832
星空のステージです
it's a stage under the starry sky.

274
01:36:01,032 --> 01:36:06,332
痛天を刺す一ツ星の眩い
The dazzling light of a single star piercing the sky,

275
01:36:06,332 --> 01:36:09,632
閃光に染まり散る
dyed in flash and scattering.

276
01:36:09,632 --> 01:36:13,332
独り占めしたはずのここも
Even this place I was supposed to have to myself,

277
01:36:13,332 --> 01:36:16,632
幕が下りれば Act 2
once the curtain falls, it's Act 2.

278
01:36:22,632 --> 01:36:24,032
そこを退けて
Move out of the way.

279
01:36:24,032 --> 01:36:27,332
譲れないわ My stage 邪魔しないで
I won't yield My stage, don't get in my way!

280
01:36:27,332 --> 01:36:31,332
綺麗に Make up してさ 待ってる人がいるの
I put on nice makeup, someone is waiting for me.

281
01:36:31,332 --> 01:36:33,032
OK?

282
01:36:33,032 --> 01:36:35,832
ところでそちら どちら様ですか？
By the way, who might you be over there?

283
01:36:35,832 --> 01:36:37,832
もういいですか？
Are you done already?

284
01:36:37,832 --> 01:36:39,832
主役って大変だわ
Being the star is hard work!

285
01:36:39,832 --> 01:36:42,632
Pop pop noise を消して
Erase the pop-pop noise,

286
01:36:42,632 --> 01:36:45,332
目と目逸らさないでね
and don't avert your eyes, okay?

287
01:36:46,332 --> 01:36:49,832
罪はどんな？ 賠償にはもううんざりだわ
What kind of sin? I'm already sick of compensation!

288
01:36:49,832 --> 01:36:52,632
熱い Heart と Music 浴びて Spotlight
Basking in hot Heart and Music under the Spotlight!

289
01:36:52,632 --> 01:36:57,632
たとえどんな闇も焦がすわ 騒がせ
No matter what darkness, I'll scorch it—make some noise!

290
01:36:57,632 --> 01:37:02,632
1, 2... 乱れ乱れもう No time! Fuck off, bye!
1, 2... go wild, go wild, No time! Fuck off, bye!

291
01:37:08,332 --> 01:37:12,332
あー 称賛絶賛ありがとう お気に召せば Let's go
Ah, thanks for the praise and acclaim! If you like it, Let's go!

292
01:37:12,332 --> 01:37:16,832
嫉妬妬み嫉みから 嫌悪感に暇なんですか？
Free enough to wallow in jealousy, envy, and disgust?

293
01:37:16,832 --> 01:37:22,632
やれ勝訴だ敗訴だの 殺すぞ？ ご機嫌よう
Winning or losing lawsuits—I'll kill you? Good day!

294
01:37:24,832 --> 01:37:27,632
Pop pop flash を浴びて
Basking in the pop-pop flash,

295
01:37:27,632 --> 01:37:30,332
耳を放さないでね
don't tune out your ears, okay?

296
01:37:47,832 --> 01:37:51,632
惨劇の扉が開くように
As if opening the door to tragedy,

297
01:37:51,632 --> 01:37:54,832
飛び込む世界は回る
the world I dive into spins round.

298
01:37:54,832 --> 01:37:58,632
劇的な終わりに続くストーリー
A story leading to a dramatic ending—

299
01:37:58,632 --> 01:38:01,832
誰のため歌い上げる？
for whom do I sing it out?

300
01:38:01,832 --> 01:38:05,832
罪はどんな？ 敗北にはもううんざりだわ
What kind of sin? I'm sick of defeat already!

301
01:38:05,832 --> 01:38:09,632
熱い Heart と Music 浴びて Spotlight
Basking in hot Heart and Music under the Spotlight!

302
01:38:09,632 --> 01:38:14,632
たとえどんなエンディングが待ち受けていても
No matter what kind of ending awaits me,

303
01:38:14,632 --> 01:38:16,832
1, 2... 乱れ乱れもう 騒がせ
1, 2... go wild, go wild, make some noise!

304
01:38:17,332 --> 01:38:21,332
きっと思いは冷めない 心冷めない夢は
Surely these feelings won't cool down; an uncooling heart's dream

305
01:38:21,332 --> 01:38:25,032
フィクションなんかじゃない
isn't just fiction!

306
01:38:25,032 --> 01:38:29,832
たとえ誰が笑っても 嘲笑ってみせ
No matter who laughs, sneer right back at them!

307
01:38:29,832 --> 01:38:33,832
Get out, No time! Fuck off, bye!

308
01:38:35,832 --> 01:38:37,632
幕開け
The curtain rises!

309
01:38:37,832 --> 01:38:40,832
立ち込める煙の中
Amidst the thick smoke,

310
01:38:40,832 --> 01:38:43,832
歌い倒せ
sing until you drop!

311
01:38:43,832 --> 01:38:47,332
Yeah

312
